          <avActivityHighlights>The Avalanche Warning Service currently has only a small amount of information that has been collected in the field. &lt;br/&gt; The wind slabs represent the main danger.</avActivityHighlights>
          <avActivityComment>Thus far the wind has been moderate to strong. In particular adjacent to ridgelines and in gullies and bowls clearly visible wind slabs formed. They can in some places be released by people, especially on north, northeast and east facing slopes.</avActivityComment>
